  "body": "At a minimum we should clearly state that strings are 0-based and that you can index into them to obtain individual code points or code units.\r\n\r\nThis should also make the work in #110 more grounded as well as several existing Infra algorithms that operate on strings.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7991 has some ideas for potentially doing more in terms of syntax, but it's not clear if that ends up paying for itself. Mainly mentioning that for completeness-sake.",
